  "scientific_conclusion": "V3-SS-CONF-001 completed successfully under the frozen protocol. DCHAG and dense sequential g-formula have competitive/statistically compatible causal-effect MAE on this confirmatory benchmark; there is no evidence that DCHAG is superior. DCHAG recovers the best control in all 16 worlds with zero normalized regret, as does dense-g. The observational association comparator is substantially worse and remains noncausal. Dense-g has slightly better held-out Brier/BSS. DCHAG structural recovery is strong but benchmark-specific."
